@startuml public_chat_event_boundary
title Public Chat Event Boundary
skinparam shadowing false

' Source evidence: mate-service@956b547f src/main/java/com/huawei/hicampus/mate/agentdefinition/controller/AgentDefinitionController.java:35-79
' Source evidence: mate-service@956b547f src/main/java/com/huawei/hicampus/mate/agentdefinition/modelmanager/controller/LlmChatController.java:33-59
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@98d3999e modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/web/RuntimeEventController.java:39-77
' Observed behavior: mate-service has no public Chat-to-Runtime event bridge in the reviewed source.
' Target-only design: mate-service authorizes Chat ownership and privately resolves chatId to sessionId.
' Design reason: browser clients use a stable product Chat resource while Runtime owns Session execution.

actor "Authenticated user" as User
component "mate-service\nChatEventController" as Mate
component "ChatSessionResolver" as Resolver
component "CampusClaw Runtime\nRuntimeEventController" as Runtime

User -> Mate : POST /mate-service/v1/chats/{chatId}/events
Mate -> Mate : authenticate user and authorize Chat
Mate -> Resolver : resolve owned Chat
Resolver --> Mate : private sessionId
Mate -> Runtime : POST /campusclaw-service/v1/sessions/{sessionId}/events
Runtime --> Mate : internal execution-scoped SSE
Mate --> User : reprojected public SSE
@enduml

@startuml public_chat_event_projection
title Public Chat Event Reprojection
skinparam shadowing false

' Source evidence: mate-service@956b547f src/main/java/com/huawei/hicampus/mate/agentdefinition/modelmanager/service/UpstreamChatCall.java:35-73
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@98d3999e modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/event/RuntimeEventProjector.java:163-219,272-345,382-385
' Observed behavior: the current mate-service model proxy forwards bytes and does not parse CampusClaw SSE frames.
' Security hardening: raw thinking, internal identifiers, credentials, paths, tool payloads, and Runtime errors are removed.
' Architecture change: the public Chat bridge parses, validates, maps, and serializes each complete SSE frame.

participant Browser
participant "PublicEventProjector" as Projector
participant "CampusClaw Runtime" as Runtime

Runtime --> Projector : internal event, id, and data
loop each complete SSE frame
  Projector -> Projector : validate known event and field shape
  Projector -> Projector : map entrySeq to public eventSeq
  Projector -> Projector : sanitize thinking and tool activity
  Projector -> Projector : remove private fields and map errors
  Projector --> Browser : serialize public SSE frame
end
note over Projector
Unknown events fail closed.
Accepted execution continues after browser disconnect.
The POST is never replayed automatically.
end note
@enduml
